# Scoped Trivy allowlist for the BLOCKING image scan (docker-publish.yml).
#
# The supercronic binary (/usr/local/bin/supercronic) is no longer listed here:
# it is excluded from the blocking scan via `skip-files` in docker-publish.yml,
# and surfaced by the non-blocking advisory scan instead. Its Go-stdlib CVEs are
# denial-of-service only, not fixable by us until upstream rebuilds with a newer
# Go, and unreachable in this image (local cron only, no HTTP listener, no TLS
# client). This stops every new supercronic Go-stdlib CVE from blocking all PRs.
#
# Add an entry below only for a genuine, case-by-case suppression in a package we
# DO control (base image / Python). Each entry needs a reason and a re-review date.
# (Currently none.)
